{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-tsx","path":"/blog/2023-04-08--blister-summit-23/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"disqus":"edward-j-schwartz"}},"post":{"html":"<p>I've mentioned a few times that I'm an avid skier.  I live in central\nPennsylvania though, and so the skiing is not always the best, to say the least!</p>\n<p>I've been going to the <a href=\"https://blisterreview.com/industry-news/blister-summit-2024-what-when-how-to-join\">BLISTER\nSummit</a>\nin Crested Butte for the past two years now, and it's been a blast.  The summit\ndefies categorization; it's a cross between a huge ski demo, meet-up, and panel\nsessions.  It's a great way to try out new gear, ski on an incredible mountain,\nand ski with some really awesome people, including <a href=\"https://www.skimag.com/athletes/athlete-profile-wendy-fisher/\">Wendy\nFisher</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Davenport\">Chris\nDavenport</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/drewpeterski/?hl=en\">Drew\nPetersen</a> and the BLISTER team.</p>\n<p>Anyway, I mostly wanted to share a few fun pictures from the event.  Somehow I\nmade it into the promo video for next year's event!  Sadly, it was not because\nof my epic skiing:</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/n-sCGq6NDjs?start=26\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<h2 id=\"pictures\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#pictures\" aria-label=\"pictures permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Pictures</h2>\n<p>I've been looking for a good excuse to post some pictures.  So, here you go!</p>\n<p><figure class=\"gatsby-resp-image-figure\" style=\"\">\n    <span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/3f12f1592f7ca8ad8960b67b306f076c/adffb/_02A1325.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 66.5%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/3f12f1592f7ca8ad8960b67b306f076c/f13a9/_02A1325.avif 200w,\n/static/3f12f1592f7ca8ad8960b67b306f076c/af71e/_02A1325.avif 400w,\n/static/3f12f1592f7ca8ad8960b67b306f076c/c9875/_02A1325.avif 800w,\n/static/3f12f1592f7ca8ad8960b67b306f076c/07e28/_02A1325.avif 1200w,\n/static/3f12f1592f7ca8ad8960b67b306f076c/2babf/_02A1325.avif 1600w,\n/static/3f12f1592f7ca8ad8960b67b306f076c/e25e5/_02A1325.avif 8192w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n              type=\"image/avif\"\n            /><source\n              srcset=\"/static/3f12f1592f7ca8ad8960b67b306f076c/ba381/_02A1325.webp 200w,\n/static/3f12f1592f7ca8ad8960b67b306f076c/7f61c/_02A1325.webp 400w,\n/static/3f12f1592f7ca8ad8960b67b306f076c/d00b9/_02A1325.webp 800w,\n/static/3f12f1592f7ca8ad8960b67b306f076c/92f8c/_02A1325.webp 1200w,\n/static/3f12f1592f7ca8ad8960b67b306f076c/fad48/_02A1325.webp 1600w,\n/static/3f12f1592f7ca8ad8960b67b306f076c/53231/_02A1325.webp 8192w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100